        {
          "title": "Remix Yourself",
          "content": "<p>这个网站要求上传三张照片，第一张是布局，第二张是样式，第三张是人像。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202404/bg2024042702.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它会将它们合成一张。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202404/bg2024042703.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Remix Yourself",
              "url": "https://styleof.com/s/remix-yourself"
            }
          ],
